{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268tAiXmt3lV1795007206.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「幻彩詠香江」晚上作告別演出。</p><p></p><p>踏正晚上8時，有22年歷史的「幻彩詠香江」，最後一次在維港上演，除了傳統的鐳射燈光，這晚特別加入了煙火元素，多幢大廈同時以煙火照亮夜空。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lS5Tv6hVGA1795007218.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2030_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X5hStNMhVz1795007247.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>整個匯演歷時10分鐘，不少市民在尖沙咀海旁舉機紀錄這一刻。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268cJKq2Kl481795007233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2030_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jkSbQ2LpOi1795007262.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「幻彩詠香江」自2004年起上演，有逾43幢建築物參加。至於代替「幻彩詠香江」的其他光影項目，會在明年陸續推出。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2030_007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JCRxRuwiUP1795007318.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩說：「今晚亦是一個重要的歷史時刻，陪伴著我們22年的『幻彩詠香江』即將上演最後一場的匯演，完成了它的歷史使命，多年來都向無數市民及旅客帶來了香港維港的天際線，璀璨夜色。今晚的匯演，我們特別加入了大廈頂樓的煙火效果，為這場經典的匯演，畫上圓滿句號。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:04:08.508404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.500230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:24.042977+00:00","content_hash":"83cd8b3954253de74ee0f14fdf49e55a09b16a8b5d037d545149b2356c4d6f7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:04:08.508404+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}